    <briefdescription>
<para>Decorator that limits maximum rate of change (slew rate / ramp). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This decorator does not own a heartbeat; it only transforms the value. Wrap it with <ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor" kindref="compound">SampledDecor</ref> to get periodic output: <verbatim>SampledDecor&lt;SlewRateDecor&lt;MyMotor, 50&gt;&gt; a;
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TMotor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Base motor class (must implement <ref refid="classevam_1_1_slew_rate_decor_1a07bb4e76257a1630b51e7632be644a84" kindref="member">Go(signed short)</ref>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tMaxStepPerTick</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Default maximum change per tick (1..1000). Default: 50 </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
